description: Run a plan-aligned Claude/Codex convergence loop where Claude acts as orchestrator/reviewer, Codex executes and verifies, optional read-only research agents gather narrow evidence, and the loop continues until evidence-backed completion, high-confidence DONE readiness review, browser proof, and conditional PR merge/posting. Use when the user asks to have Claude direct the next step, run a Claude/Codex loop, make Claude the orchestrator and Codex the executor, converge with Claude, or execute with repeated Claude feedback.
