docs/course-production/MODULE-PRODUCTION-GUIDE.md:11:Doodle-style training videos for BMH Group's 19-module Follow-Up Specialist course. Each lesson ≈ 3–6 min: **Andrea** (HeyGen avatar) narrates; flat doodle scenes illustrate; Remotion assembles. Locked visual brand: flat sticker-sheet doodle, thick wobbly black outlines, flat fills, **5-color palette (yellow #FFD23F-ish, orange, cream #FFF7DE, white, black) on cornflower blue `#62b3f3`** — no gradients, no shading, no skin tones, no text baked into AI images.
