docs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_18B.sh:25:STYLE='STYLE: flat sticker-sheet doodle illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, rounded corners, flat fills only in the locked palette: cornflower-blue #62b3f3 background, yellow, orange, cream, white, and black. No gradients, no texture, no shadows, no lighting, no perspective, no skin-tone shading. Faces and hands use flat white/cream fill, tiny dot eyes, a small subtle curved cast-board nose, simple mouth. Cylindrical limbs, strong simple silhouettes, confidently imperfect hand-drawn. No ambient doodles: no hearts, sparkles, notes, thought bubbles, speech bubbles, motion marks, random icons, random props, or decorative clutter. No real app logos. No text, letters, words, numbers, labels, captions, UI labels, readable messages, or readable paperwork anywhere; all Slack/Sandra/DialPad/Gmail labels and county names will be code-rendered later with Sticker overlays. Use blank app-like panes, blank message bubbles, blank channel rows, blank cards, and blank pseudo-lines only. Leave clean open cornflower-blue space for code-rendered Sticker overlays. 16:9 composition, 1600x900 PNG.'
docs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_18B.sh:53:    gen "m18_L18B_b02_county-channels.png" "County geography visual on a plain cornflower-blue field. Center: one large abstract regional map only, made from multiple county-like sections separated by thick black hand-drawn boundary lines. Several different county sections are shaded with the locked BMH palette: flat yellow, orange, cream, and white fills; other sections stay cream/white. The map should read as counties grouped by geography, not as an app screen. Do NOT include a list, sidebar, message cards, Slack-style channel rows, UI panes, pins, roads, rivers, real map outlines, real county shapes, real labels, text, letters, numbers, or logos. No people. Keep clean open blue space around the map for later code labels." ;;
course-assets/scenes/module-19/_logs/m19_L19_b02_foundation-conveyor.png.log:15:Generate one image with gpt-image-2 and save it to course-assets/scenes/module-19/m19_L19_b02_foundation-conveyor.png (PNG, 1600x900). Match the attached BMH course doodle references exactly. PRIYA / BMH representative identity: woman follow-up representative, black back ponytail, orange/yellow headband, orange headset with boom mic, yellow top, cream pants, orange shoes, flat white/cream face and hands, small dot eyes, tiny curved cast-board nose, simple friendly mouth. Keep Priya identical to the attached Priya/operator reference and cast board. COMPOSITION: Conveyor-belt qualification machine scene. A simple conveyor belt runs left to right through a friendly boxy machine. On the left, a messy raw lead card enters the machine: rough-edged blank paper, loose blank notes, question-mark-like abstract shapes without real punctuation marks if possible, unorganized stack. On the right, a clean qualified lead packet exits: neat blank folder, organized blank rows, check boxes with simple check marks, ready tray. Priya stands beside the machine operating it, proud but focused. EXACTLY ONE PERSON. The machine transformation must be obvious even with no words. STYLE: flat sticker-sheet doodle illustration, thick black hand-drawn outlines with a slight wobble, rounded corners, flat fills only in the locked palette: cornflower-blue #62b3f3 background, yellow #FFD23F, orange, cream #FFF7DE, white, and black. No gradients, no texture, no shading, no shadows, no lighting, no perspective, no skin-tone shading. Faces and hands use flat white/cream fill, tiny dot eyes, a small subtle curved cast-board nose like a tiny hook/comma, simple mouth. Cylindrical limbs, strong simple silhouettes, confidently imperfect hand-drawn. No ambient doodles: no hearts, sparkles, notes, thought bubbles, speech bubbles, motion marks, random icons, random props, or decorative clutter. No text, letters, words, numbers, labels, captions, UI labels, readable screens, readable messages, readable paperwork, real app logos, or screenshots anywhere. Use blank app-like panes, blank cards, blank rows, blank message bubbles, blank check boxes, blank pseudo-lines, and blank signs only. Leave clean open cornflower-blue space for code-rendered Sticker overlays. 16:9 composition, 1600x900 PNG. NEGATIVE: no duplicate people, no extra characters beyond the requested count, no Andrea narrator, no skin-tone colors, no brown/tan/peach/pink cheeks, no readable text, no logos, no watermarks, no realistic UI, no decorative filler, no clutter, no clipped subject.
